# Vulnerabilities this project has looked at and decided not to block on.
#
# The policy this file is an exception to is in docs/operations/images.md:
# a scan fails on CRITICAL or HIGH with a fix available, and unfixed
# findings are reported rather than blocking. Adding a line here waives one
# of those, which is a decision a maintainer makes in a pull request like
# any other change - never a thing done to make a red build go green.
#
# Every entry needs three things: the identifier, why it does not apply or
# cannot be fixed today, and when it should be looked at again. An entry
# past its date is a bug in this file.
#
# CVE-2024-00000 exp:2026-12-31
#   In a transitive dependency of X, reachable only from the CLI entry point
#   Primer does not ship. Upstream fix expected in X 2.0.
